# Environment File Template for /etc/xiaoshuo-bot/xiaoshuo.env
# Permissions MUST be locked to 0600 (chmod 0600 /etc/xiaoshuo-bot/xiaoshuo.env).
# Replace ALL __REPLACE_...__ placeholders before starting services.

# --- Matrix HTTP/SSE Server Bind & Auth ---
XIAOSHUO_HOST=127.0.0.1
XIAOSHUO_PORT=8080
XIAOSHUO_DATA_DIR=/opt/xiaoshuo-bot/data
XIAOSHUO_PROJECTS_ROOT=/opt/xiaoshuo-bot/projects

# Public HTTPS domain served by Caddy auto-HTTPS (deploy/Caddyfile.example {$XIAOSHUO_DOMAIN}).
# deploy_remote.sh substitutes this into the Caddyfile; plain-IP HTTP serving is NOT supported.
XIAOSHUO_DOMAIN=__REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DOMAIN__

# REQUIRED even on 127.0.0.1: minimum 24 characters, enforced by server/auth.py and
# deploy_remote.sh preflight (generate via: openssl rand -hex 32)
XIAOSHUO_ADMIN_TOKEN=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_ADMIN_TOKEN__

# Cloud-edge HMAC shared secret (server/auth.py reads XIAOSHUO_COMPANION_SECRET)
XIAOSHUO_COMPANION_SECRET=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_COMPANION_HMAC_SECRET__
XIAOSHUO_COMPANION_HMAC_SECRET=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_COMPANION_HMAC_SECRET__

# --- Local CPA (CLIProxyAPI) Gateway & Management ---
CPA_MANAGEMENT_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8317
CPA_MANAGEMENT_KEY=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_CPA_MANAGEMENT_SECRET_KEY__

# cli.py reads XIAOSHUO_BASE_URL; llm/openai_compat.py reads XIAOSHUO_API_BASE
XIAOSHUO_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8317/v1
XIAOSHUO_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8317/v1
XIAOSHUO_API_KEY=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_CPA_LOCAL_GATEWAY_KEY__
XIAOSHUO_MODEL=__REPLACE_WITH_WRITER_MODEL_ID__

# --- WorkBuddy 4-Model Whitelist Mapping (populated from real GET /v1/models after login) ---
# Zero hardcoded guessed IDs; server startup verifies all 4 against CPA /v1/models.
# Forbidden: DeepSeek-V4-Pro, auto / 快速 / 均衡 / 极致. Hy4 is manual-only (never auto-rotates).
WORKBUDDY_MODEL_HY4_FLASH=__REPLACE_WITH_WORKBUDDY_HY4_FLASH_MODEL_ID__
WORKBUDDY_MODEL_HY4=__REPLACE_WITH_WORKBUDDY_HY4_MODEL_ID__
WORKBUDDY_MODEL_DEEPSEEK_V4_1_FLASH=__REPLACE_WITH_WORKBUDDY_DEEPSEEK_V4_1_FLASH_MODEL_ID__
WORKBUDDY_MODEL_MIMO_V2_6_PRO=__REPLACE_WITH_WORKBUDDY_MIMO_V2_6_PRO_MODEL_ID__
# HTTP 429 rate-limit backoff schedule on same model before rotating (seconds, comma-separated)
WORKBUDDY_RATE_LIMIT_BACKOFF_SEC=30,60,120
# Cooldown duration for an exhausted model before auto-restoring on next chapter (seconds, default 1h)
WORKBUDDY_MODEL_COOLDOWN_SEC=3600

XIAOSHUO_IMAGE_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8317
XIAOSHUO_IMAGE_API_KEY=__REPLACE_WITH_64_HEX_CPA_LOCAL_GATEWAY_KEY__
XIAOSHUO_IMAGE_MODEL=__REPLACE_WITH_GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL_ID__

# --- Telegram Bot Remote Control (Long Polling, Zero Inbound Ports) ---
TELEGRAM_API_BASE_URL=https://api.telegram.org
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=__REPLACE_WITH_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN__
TELEGRAM_OWNER_USER_ID=__REPLACE_WITH_NUMERIC_TELEGRAM_OWNER_USER_ID__
